---
description: Construct alternatives that retain essential outcomes and hard access commitments.
args:{event:EventProductionState;commitments:PromiseLedgerItem[];failure:Disruption[]}
returns:string[]
---
Consider resequencing, remote participation or an approved equivalent format using only available resources. Preserve accessibility arrangements and essential outcomes. Reject options that require unsupported equipment, consent or staffing. Keep sponsor and commercial changes routed for separate authorized approval.
